<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/6/eng@/~cl_12__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) For the purposes of subsection (1)— (a) in relation to the appointment of a guardian, the Estate Distribution Officer shall have regard to any personal law or custom affecting the minor or person of unsound mind; and (b) in relation to the appointment of a next friend, the Estate Distribution Officer shall have regard to any personal law or custom, and any circumstances or medical reason rendering a patient unable to represent himself.”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/6/eng@> .
