<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/6/eng@/~cl_20> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 17(2) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “, the Land Administrator may either” the words “or a person of unsound mind has been certified by a Government Medical Officer that the person is no longer a person of unsound mind, the Estate Distribution Officer may either request the Land Administrator or Registrar of Titles to”. Substitution of section 18"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/6/eng@> .
