<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/6/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Small Estates (Distribution) Act 1955 [Act 98], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended by substituting for the words “Land Administrator”, wherever appearing including in the shoulder notes the words “Estate Distribution Officer”, except in the definition of “Land Administrator” in section 2, sections 23, 24, 26b and 26c of the principal Act. Amendment of section 2"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/6/eng@> .
